     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><ul style=\"margin:1.2em 0px;padding-left:2em\">\r\n<li style=\"margin:0.5em 0px\"><strong>Date</strong>: <strike>Thursday, Mar 26</strike> <span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">Cancelled</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"margin:0.5em 0px\"><strong>Time</strong>: <strike>perhaps 6pm? (TBD)</strike></li>\r\n<li style=\"margin:0.5em 0px\"><strong>Location</strong>: TBD</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin:0.5em 0px\"><strong>Topic</strong>: TBD</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">We never discussed the topic for the next meeting. I have several suggestions:</p>\r\n<ol style=\"margin:1.2em 0px;padding-left:2em\">\r\n<li style=\"margin:0.5em 0px\">Multi-plot graphics (e.g., faceting and composite graphics, ala <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">par(mfrow=...)</code>, <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">layout()</code>, and <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">par(fig=...)</code>)</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin:0.5em 0px\">Multi-plot graphics (e.g., faceting ala <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">lattice</code>)</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin:0.5em 0px\">R Markdown</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin:0.5em 0px\"><em>R</em> workflow using <code style=